    {
      "id": "note-marketing-in",
      "name": "Note: in",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -100,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 620,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 1 The email comes in\nWhen you run an eval, the kit sends each test email (a **case**) to **Case in**. The email text is in `input.email`. **Read the rules** loads all the owner's rules of this engine (`usecases/marketing/n8n/rules/*.md`; kit UI → **Rules**, engine n8n).\n\n**See the data of one eval case:** kit results → the case → **n8n execution ↗** → double-click a node."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-marketing-triage",
      "name": "Note: triage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 540,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 2 Triage (AI)\nOne model call sorts the email: category, flags, sender address.\nPrompt: **Triage** > Chat Messages > Message.\nThe fields: **Triage model** > Options > Response Format.\n**Triage fields** reads the answer."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-marketing-gate",
      "name": "Note: gate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1060,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 240,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 3 Junk? (a rule, no AI)\nTriage says `no_reply` (the owner's routing rules): no reply, no more AI calls.\nChange the rule in **Junk?**, or the `no_reply` line in `n8n/rules/routing.md` (kit UI → **Rules**)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-marketing-context",
      "name": "Note: context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 540,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 4 Look things up (no AI)\nWho is the sender? Did they write before?\nThe tool nodes ask the kit's **tools server** on your laptop (`/call/<tool>`). It reads the files in `data/`.\nMore context: copy a node, change the tool in the URL and the fields."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-marketing-draft",
      "name": "Note: draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1880,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 540,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 5 Decide and draft (AI)\n**The main prompt is here**: **Decide and draft** > Chat Messages > Message (the steps). Change one thing, Publish, run the eval again.\n**Draft model** > Options > Response Format forces the result shape of the case (`output.schema.json`): a schema change needs no edit here.\n**Read result** reads the answer."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-marketing-out",
      "name": "Note: out",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2440,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 6 Result out\nSends the result to the kit.\nAfter an edit: **Publish** (top right). The eval runs only the published version, and saves it to `n8n/workflow.json` and `n8n/prompts/`."
      }
    }
